f the Ringwraiths and Sauron's most powerful servant.","tags":["Nazgûl","Enemy"],"isAlive":true,"relationshipIds":["rel_frodo_witchking"],"portraitImageId":"RhIjkvVWPGrUjOu-HpkE5","updatedAt":1784550029705,"color":null,"createdAt":1784550029705},{"id":"gaMFJoHCGZ1Am304RxILF","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","name":"Farmer Maggot","portraitImageId":"P8KVyVRG0wGAfcWs49D09","aliases":[],"description":"A stout, no-nonsense Hobbit farmer who lives in the Marish.","tags":["Hobbit","Farmer"],"relationshipIds":["rel_frodo_maggot"],"isAlive":true,"createdAt":1784550029705,"updatedAt":1784550029705,"color":null},{"id":"kLQ9TiNBdeAWrkOgoq_Vw","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","name":"Saruman the White","aliases":["Curunír"],"description":"Head of the White Council whose attempt to recruit and imprison Gandalf reveals his treason.","portraitImageId":"tt-linked-art-saruman","color":"#e5e7eb","tags":["wizard","antagonist"],"isAlive":true,"createdAt":1784550029705,"updatedAt":1784550029705},{"id":"kjbEE6Y6eRMFCze5L0g2J","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","name":"Old Man Willow","portraitImageId":"Y4YUZVGZfEplslv7qXUgf","aliases":[],"description":"A sentient, malevolent tree that controls much of the Old Forest.","tags":["Tree","Enemy"],"relationshipIds":["rel_frodo_willow"],"isAlive":true,"createdAt":1784550029705,"updatedAt":1784550029705,"color":null},{"id":"kkPl57ArKCf2MwCknN5wN","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","name":"Tom Bombadil","portraitImageId":"PU7I9-JGWxKE-S_mA07o4","aliases":["Iarwain Ben-adar"],"description":"A merry, mysterious, and immensely powerful being residing in the Old Forest.","tags":["Unknown"],"relationshipIds":["rel_frodo_tom"],"isAlive":true,"createdAt":1784550029705,"updatedAt":1784550029705,"color":null},{"id":"l8D-LSQ00Ur6U30y7Jd7X","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","name":"Elendil","aliases":["The Tall"],"description":"Leader of the Dúnedain realms in exile and father of Isildur.","portraitImageId":"tt-linked-art-elendil","color":"#2563eb","tags":[