e hobbits meet Treebeard and stir the Entmoot toward war.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-5","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-rohan","number":5,"title":"The White Rider","synopsis":"The Three Hunters discover Gandalf returned in white.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-6","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-rohan","number":6,"title":"The King of the Golden Hall","synopsis":"Gandalf frees Théoden from despair and exposes Gríma.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-7","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-rohan","number":7,"title":"Helm's Deep","synopsis":"Rohan withstands Saruman's army until Gandalf and Erkenbrand arrive.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-8","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-rohan","number":8,"title":"The Road to Isengard","synopsis":"The victors find Isengard ruined by the Ents.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-9","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-rohan","number":9,"title":"Flotsam and Jetsam","synopsis":"Merry and Pippin recount the Ents' destruction of Isengard.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-10","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-rohan","number":10,"title":"The Voice of Saruman","synopsis":"Saruman's persuasion fails; Gandalf breaks his staff and Gríma throws down a palantír.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-11","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-rohan","number":11,"title":"The Palantír","synopsis":"Pippin encounters Sauron through the stone and rides east with Gandalf.","notes":"Book III","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-12","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-mordor","number":12,"title":"The Taming of Sméagol","synopsis":"Frodo and Sam capture Gollum and bind him to guide them.","notes":"Book IV","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-13","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-mordor","number":13,"title":"The Passage of the Marshes","synopsis":"Gollum leads the hobbits through the haunted Dead Marshes.","notes":"Book IV","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-14","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-mordor","number":14,"title":"The Black Gate is Closed","synopsis":"Gollum persuades Frodo to seek a secret southern route.","notes":"Book IV","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-15","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-mordor","number":15,"title":"Of Herbs and Stewed Rabbit","synopsis":"Sam's cooking attracts Faramir's Rangers during an ambush.","notes":"Book IV","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-16","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-mordor","number":16,"title":"The Window on the West","synopsis":"Faramir questions the hobbits and rejects the Ring.","notes":"Book IV","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-17","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-mordor","number":17,"title":"The Forbidden Pool","synopsis":"Frodo saves Gollum and Faramir releases them with a warning.","notes":"Book IV","wordGoal":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-ch-18","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","timelineId":"tt-timeline-mordor","number":18,"title":"Journey