ol and Gollum are divided","description":"Competing loyal and murderous impulses argue within Gollum.","tags":["gollum","identity"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"tt-ev-13-smeagol-and-gollum-debate","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-kf-faramir-brother","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","title":"Faramir is Boromir's brother","description":"The Ithilien captain recognizes signs of Boromir's fate.","tags":["faramir","boromir"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"tt-ev-16-news-of-boromir","originEventId":null,"createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-kf-faramir-ring","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","title":"Faramir learns Frodo carries the Ring","description":"Sam inadvertently names the enemy's weapon.","tags":["faramir","ring"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"tt-ev-16-sam-reveals-the-ring","originEventId":"tt-ev-16-sam-reveals-the-ring","createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-kf-faramir-refuses","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","title":"Faramir refuses the Ring","description":"He rejects the opportunity even after learning what Frodo carries.","tags":["faramir","choice"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"tt-ev-16-faramir-rejects-temptation","originEventId":"tt-ev-16-faramir-rejects-temptation","createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-kf-gollum-betrayed","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","title":"Gollum feels Frodo betrayed him","description":"The capture at the Forbidden Pool damages his remaining loyalty.","tags":["gollum","betrayal"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"tt-ev-17-gollum-feels-betrayed","originEventId":"tt-ev-17-gollum-feels-betrayed","createdAt":1784551000000,"updatedAt":1784551000000},{"id":"tt-kf-cirith-danger","worldId":"mOlU8GWK_NGtK-STFFtqC","title":"Cirith Ungol is dangerously secret","description":"Faramir recognizes the name and warns Frodo without knowing Shelob's full role.","tags":["cirith-ungol","warning"],"readerLearnsAtEventId":"tt-ev-17-faramir-s-warning","origin